meta {
  name: Get Actor By Person Id
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{API_URL}}/actor/{{TMDB_PERSON_ID}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Retrieves an actor by their TMDb person ID, with a films array of every
  film they are credited in (newest first, directors populated).

  Each film has a lead flag: true when the actor is tagged as a lead in it,
  false for a supporting role. The films leave out cast, production companies
  and collection, like the film lists.

  The actor has imdbPersonId once it has been looked up: an IMDb "nm" ID, or
  null when TMDb has none. It is absent for people never looked up.

  Set the TMDB_PERSON_ID environment variable to test this endpoint.

  Example TMDb person IDs:
  - 2963 (Nicolas Cage)
}
